rpicam-hello --list-cameras - view all available camera

rpicam-hello - A basic camera preview application to verify hardware and focus.

rpicam-still - A comprehensive application for capturing high-resolution still images in various formats.

rpicam-vid - An application for recording video files using hardware encoding or software libraries.

rpicam-jpeg -A lightweight, high-speed alternative to rpicam-still specifically for JPEG capture.

rpicam-raw - A tool for capturing raw, unprocessed Bayer data directly from the camera sensor.

rpicam-apps-version - Displays the version information of the installed camera application suite.

